    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the dungeon as an artifact-collecting crow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Articrow is a top-down action roguelike game about a cute crow exploring dungeons to find the ultimate artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect artifacts and create your own magical combinations to conquer dungeons in a charming pixel-art world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather mana to use a variety of magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Artifacts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine skill parts to create your own powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Ways to Attack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use basic attacks to recover mana, and unleash powerful skills on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the final boss and escape the dungeon!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the dungeon as an artifact-collecting crow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Articrow is a top-down action roguelike game about a cute crow exploring dungeons to find the ultimate artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect artifacts and create your own magical combinations to conquer dungeons in a charming pixel-art world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather mana to use a variety of magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Artifacts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine skill parts to create your own powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Ways to Attack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use basic attacks to recover mana, and unleash powerful skills on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the final boss and escape the dungeon!</p>",
